图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"An agent-native compilation & verification pipeline that converts software capabilities such as CLI, APIs, and local services into installable, testable, verifiable DeepSeek Harness plugins.","id":"gh:1373204196","install_available":false,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-plugin-anything","slug":"rootkiller6788/dsh-plugin-anything","topics":["ai-agents","deepseek","deepseek-harness","developer-tools","dsh-plugin","plugin-system"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"An agent-native compilation & verification pipeline that converts software capabilities such as CLI,"},{"id":"p1s2","text":" APIs, and local services into installable, testable, verifiable DeepSeek Harness plugins."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"dsh-plugin-anything: Making ALL Software DSH-Native"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Turn anything into a DeepSeek Harness plugin."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"One pipeline, one compiler, one verifier — for the harness where everything is already a plugin."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"An agent-native compiler and verification pipeline that turns software capabilities into\ninstallable"},{"id":"p5s2","text":", tested, and verified DSH plugins."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"**One command**: `dsh plugin --profile <profile> add dsh-plugin-anything-bundle` — install, restart,"},{"id":"p6s2","text":" and call\nthe tools. Surviving the restart is the whole point; it is what a dynamic package cannot d"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"nd call\nthe tools. Surviving the restart is the whole point; it is what a dynamic package cannot do."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Golden E2E"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"The claim is in the name, and a claim like that is worth what its weakest category is worth. Each ca"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"tegory is\na small but real representative, run through the whole deterministic pipeline — IR → compi"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"le → static gate →\nbuild → typecheck → package integrity:"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"The table above is **generated by that command and pinned by `scripts/check-readme-status.mjs`** — a"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"\nhand-maintained status table drifts, and a drifted one is read as current."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"**MCP's PASS is a refusal, and that is the correct outcome.** An MCP server already has a supported "},{"id":"p13s2","text":"route\ninto `dsh`; generating a plugin for one duplicates that route. Its golden case asserts the com"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"piler refuses\nit *and names the route to use instead* — a category that \"passed\" by emitting a redun"},{"id":"p13s4","text":"dant plugin would be a\nregression, and `bundle/src/compile.ts` throws to prevent it."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## The pipeline is the unit, not the tool"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"`bundle/src/pipeline.ts` carries twenty stages, each with an owner and the reason\nfor that owner. Co"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"verage is computed from it, never asserted:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"| Owner | Meaning | If it has no tool |"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"| `deterministic` | Has a correct answer, or a contract that cannot be re-derived per run | **A hole"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"** |\n| `runtime` | Reachable only through a running harness | **A hole** |\n| `agent` | Requires judg"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"ement | Correct — mechanizing it replaces intelligence with a heuristic |\n| `external` | Owned outsi"},{"id":"p17s4","text":"de this project | Nothing; named so the pipeline has no silent gap |"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Eight tools cover fifteen stages, because a verdict like acceptance is one decision made of seven ch"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"ecks.\n**The coverage number is the thing to watch — not the tool count.** `docs/pipeline.md` is\nthe "},{"id":"p18s3","text":"he coverage number is the thing to watch — not the tool count.** `docs/pipeline.md` is\nthe full map."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## What this is"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness (`dsh`) is built on vendored Cordis,\nwhere **everything is a plugin**: the model ad"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"apter, the tool registry, the session log, and the agent loop\nitself. There is no privileged core, a"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"nd every part is replaceable from `cordis.patch.yml` — the user's\nown layer, applied after every bun"},{"id":"p20s4","text":"art is replaceable from `cordis.patch.yml` — the user's\nown layer, applied after every bundle layer."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"`dsh-plugin-anything` is the missing on-ramp to that architecture. Given any operable target — an ex"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"ternal\nCLI, an HTTP/REST API, a local service — it produces an installable **plugin bundle** that a "},{"id":"p21s3","text":"`dsh` agent can\nload, call, and still have after a restart."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"It is a deliberate **isomorphic mirror of CLI-Anything**: the same\nphase-by-phase methodology, the s"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"ame \"use the real system, don't reimplement it\" iron rule, the same\nregistry packaging — with every "},{"id":"p22s3","text":"landing point translated into `dsh`'s native concepts."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"| CLI-Anything | dsh-plugin-anything |"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"| GUI software → agent-usable CLI | anything → dsh plugin bundle |\n| `HARNESS.md` 8-phase SOP | the "},{"id":"p24s2","text":"same 8 phases, dsh landing points |\n| `core/` + `utils/<sw>_backend.py` | `src/` + `src/provider.ts`"},{"id":"p24s3","text":" (the single egress module) |\n| `click` + REPL | `defineTool` + `ctx.tools.register` |\n| `SKILL.md` "},{"id":"p24s4","text":"| `SKILL.md` (dsh frontmatter) + a mount row |\n| `setup.py` → PyPI | `package.json` → npm / tarball "},{"id":"p24s5","text":"/ git |\n| `registry.json` + `cli-hub` | the existing `market` registry — **reused, not rebuilt** |"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Why it exists"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"`dsh` already ships a loop that generates plugins from a request: the `cordis` agent preset mounts\n`"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"tool-cordis`, and the model can inspect its own runtime, write a package, and run it. That loop is\ne"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"xcellent for exploration and useless for delivery:"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"> Dynamic packages live only in the shared DSH process memory. […] They create no Plugin file, insta"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"ll no\n> package, change no `cordis.yml` or personal/project configuration, **do not survive restart,"},{"id":"p27s3","text":" and cannot be\n> promoted automatically.**\n> — `packages/extensions/tool-cordis/README.md`"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"**The gap is not generation. It is promotion** — turning something that works for one session into a"},{"id":"p28s2","text":" bundle\nthat persists, installs, and distributes. That, plus the SOP, templates, verifier, and CI di"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"scipline around\nit, is what this project provides."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## Layout"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"Two of those directories matter for distribution, and only one of them is published:"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"| Directory | What it is | How it ships |"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"| `bundle/` | The npm package `dsh-plugin-anything-bundle` | `cd bundle && npm publish` — installed "},{"id":"p33s2","text":"by `dsh plugin add` |\n| `kit/` | The SOP, templates, and gate | **Nothing to publish.** It is what t"},{"id":"p33s3","text":"his repository's own tooling and agents read. |"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"## Quick start"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"## The kit"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"The methodology, templates, and gate that produce installable bundles. **A generated bundle is an ou"},{"id":"p37s2","text":"tput of\nit, and nothing here is derived from a generated bundle.**"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"### Contents"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"| Path | What it is |"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"| `HARNESS.md` | The 8-phase SOP. Read it before anything else. |\n| `commands/` | Slash commands tha"},{"id":"p40s2","text":"t execute the SOP: `/plugin-anything`, `:list`, `:refine`, `:test`, `:validate` |\n| `guides/` | Prog"},{"id":"p40s3","text":"ressive disclosure. Each guide is loaded on demand, never up front. |\n| `templates/` | The files a g"},{"id":"p40s4","text":"enerated bundle is assembled from — manifest, patch, plugin entry, provider, tool, build config, ski"},{"id":"p40s5","text":"ll |\n| `scripts/verify-plugin.mjs` | The static gate. Catches what fails silently. |\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
